type FaceLandmarks = {eyes: readonly (readonly [number, number])[]; brow: readonly (readonly [number, number])[]; nose: readonly [number, number]; nostrils: readonly (readonly [number, number])[]; mouth: readonly [number, number]; eye: number; lip: number; mw: number; fem: number}
type FaceExpressionReading = {eyes: {o: number; low?: number; iris?: number}[]; brows: {lift?: number; tilt?: number; arch?: number}[]; mouth: {s?: number; o?: number; O?: number; w?: number; asym?: number; teeth?: number}; blink?: number; talk?: number; look?: number[]}

function segDist(x: number, y: number, ax: number, ay: number, bx: number, by: number): number {
  const dx = bx - ax, dy = by - ay, t = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, ((x - ax) * dx + (y - ay) * dy) / (dx * dx + dy * dy)));
  return Math.hypot(x - ax - t * dx, y - ay - t * dy);
}


function faceTone(x: number, y: number, L: FaceLandmarks, E: FaceExpressionReading): number {
  let t = 0;
  const ell = (cx: number, cy: number, rx: number, ry: number) => ((x - cx) / rx) ** 2 + ((y - cy) / ry) ** 2;
  for(const [nx, ny] of L.nostrils) if(ell(nx, ny, 17 * (1 - .15 * L.fem), 9) < 1) t = .85;
  if(ell(L.nose[0], L.nose[1] + 22, 52 * (1 - .15 * L.fem), 12) < 1) t = Math.max(t, .22);
  if(Math.abs(Math.abs(x - L.nose[0]) - 40 * (1 - .15 * L.fem)) < 9 && y > L.eyes[0][1] + 45 && y < L.nose[1] - 8) t = Math.max(t, .12);
  if(ell(L.mouth[0], L.mouth[1] + 64 * L.lip, 78, 13) < 1) t = Math.max(t, .2);

  for(let i = 0; i < 2; i++){
    const [ex, ey] = L.eyes[i], e = E.eyes[i], b = E.brows[i], inner = i === 0 ? 1 : -1, sE = L.eye;
    const A = 88 * sE, Hu = 32 * sE, Hl = 28 * sE, u = (x - ex) / A;
    const o = e.o * (E.blink ?? 1);
    if(Math.abs(u) < 1.02){
      const w1 = 1 - u * u;
      const up = ey - 4 - Hu * o * w1;
      const lo = ey + Hl * w1 * (1 - (e.low || 0) * .55) * Math.min(1, o * 2.5);
      if(o > .06){
        if(Math.abs(y - up) < 7 * sE + 2.5 * L.fem) return 1;
        if(y > up && y < lo){
          const lk = E.look || [0, 0];
          const r = Math.hypot(x - ex - lk[0] * sE, y - ey + 2 - lk[1]), R = 30 * sE * (e.iris || 1);
          return r < 13 * sE * (e.iris || 1) ? 1 : r < R ? .72 : .02;
        }
        if(Math.abs(y - lo) < 4) t = Math.max(t, .6);
        if(Math.abs(y - (up - 20 * sE)) < 3.5 && Math.abs(u) < .9) t = Math.max(t, .3);
        if(e.low && y > lo + 6 && y < lo + 26 && Math.abs(u) < .85) t = Math.max(t, .22 * e.low);
      } else if(Math.abs(y - (ey + 6 * w1)) < 7) return 1;
    }
    if(L.fem > .5 && E.blink !== 0 && o > .06){
      const s = (x - ex) * -inner / A;
      if(s > .82 && s < 1.2 && Math.abs(y - (ey - 6 - (s - .82) * 55)) < 5) return 1;
    }
    if(ell(ex, ey, A * 1.25, 62 * sE) < 1) t = Math.max(t, .08);
    const [bx, by0] = L.brow[i], ub = (x - bx) / (A * 1.05);
    if(Math.abs(ub) < 1.15){
      const uin = ub * inner;
      const by = by0 - (b.lift || 0) - (b.arch || 0) * (1 - ub * ub) + (b.tilt || 0) * uin - 10 * L.fem * Math.exp(-(((uin + .3) / .45) ** 2));
      const th = (11 - 4 * L.fem) * (1 - .5 * Math.max(0, -uin));
      if(Math.abs(y - by) < th) t = Math.max(t, .92);
    }
  }

  const [mx, my] = L.mouth, m = E.mouth, sL = L.lip;
  const o = E.talk ?? m.o ?? 0;
  if(m.O){
    const cy = my + 12, rx = 36, ry = 50 * o * sL;
    if(ell(mx, cy, rx, ry) < 1) return 1;
    if(ell(mx, cy, rx + 16, ry + 16) < 1) t = Math.max(t, .42);
    return t;
  }
  const W = 128 * (m.w || 1) * L.mw, u = (x - mx) / W;
  if(Math.abs(u) < 1.06){
    const w1 = 1 - u * u;
    const yp = my - ((m.s || 0) * 32 * u * u + (m.asym || 0) * 16 * u), H = 58 * sL;
    const cTop = yp - o * H * .3 * w1, cBot = yp + o * H * w1;
    const upTop = yp - 24 * sL * (1 - .5 * u * u) + 6 * sL * Math.exp(-((u / .14) ** 2));
    const loBot = cBot + 28 * sL * (1 - .62 * u * u);
    if(o > .04 && y > cTop && y < cBot) return m.teeth && y < cTop + 13 ? .07 : 1;
    if(o <= .04 && Math.abs(y - yp) < 5.5) return 1;
    if(y > upTop && y <= Math.min(cTop, yp)) t = Math.max(t, .55);
    if(y >= Math.max(cBot, yp) && y < loBot) t = Math.max(t, .42);
    if(Math.abs(u) > .9 && Math.abs(y - yp) < 6) t = Math.max(t, .75);
  }
  const s = m.s || 0;
  for(const side of [-1, 1]){
    const yc = my - (s * 32 + (m.asym || 0) * 16 * side), cx = mx + side * (W + 6);
    if(s > .3 && segDist(x, y, mx + side * 70 * L.mw, L.nose[1] + 10, cx, yc - 4) < 5) t = Math.max(t, .32 * s);
    if(s < -.2 && segDist(x, y, cx, yc, mx + side * W * .85, my + 78) < 5) t = Math.max(t, .3 * -s);
  }
  return t;
}


function mixHex(a: string, b: string, t: number): string {
  const h = (s: string) => /^#[0-9a-f]{6}$/i.test(s) ? [1, 3, 5].map(i => parseInt(s.slice(i, i + 2), 16)) : null;
  const A = h(a), B = h(b);
  if(!A || !B) return a;
  t = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, t));
  return '#' + A.map((v, i) => Math.round(v + (B[i] - v) * t).toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join('');
}


function faceColours(ink: string, wash: string, ground: string) {
  const skin = mixHex(ground, wash, .08)
  return {ink, skin, line: mixHex(skin, ink, .38), ground}
}

export type FaceExpr = (typeof MASK_EXPRS)[number]

/** The specimen's mask(), static branch only: silhouette, skin, and the
 * inked polygon groups. No animation loop — a panel face at rest. */
export function maskStatic(expr: string, ink: string, wash: string, size = 150, ground = '#1b1d20'): string {
  const EXPR_TABLE = FACE_EXPRS as Record<string, object>
  const E = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(EXPR_TABLE[expr] ?? FACE_EXPRS.neutral))
  const G = GEOM
  const C = faceColours(ink, wash, ground)
  const [bx, by, bw, bh] = BOX
  const h = Math.round(size * bh / bw)
  const sw = Math.min(6, 1.2 * bw / size).toFixed(2)
  const tones = G.cen.map(([x, y]) => faceTone(x, y, G.lm, E))
  const groups = new Map<number, string[]>()
  tones.forEach((t, i) => {
    const q = Math.round(t * 20) / 20
    if (q > 0) {
      if (!groups.has(q)) groups.set(q, [])
      groups.get(q)!.push('M' + G.pts[i].replace(/ /g, 'L') + 'Z')
    }
  })
  return `<svg class="pface" width="${size}" height="${h}" viewBox="${bx} ${by} ${bw} ${bh}">
    <path class="sil" d="${G.silPath}" fill="${C.line}" stroke="${C.line}" stroke-width="${sw}" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <path class="skin" d="${G.skinPath}" fill="${C.skin}"/>
    ${[...groups].map(([q, ds]) => `<path d="${ds.join('')}" fill="${ink}" fill-opacity="${q}"/>`).join('')}
  </svg>`
}
